<mxCell id="jbc5" value="Job trigger and run parameters" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#FFF0B8;strokeColor=#B08900;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#4D3B00;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;collapsible=0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;swimlaneLine=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="150" width="580" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="jbc6" value="PROD: daily &lt;b&gt;04:00&lt;/b&gt; Europe/Brussels (schedule paused on dev / UAT). One run at a time, ≤ 48 h, e-mail on failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;run_mode&lt;/b&gt;: incremental (default) · full (re-parse all, checkpoint cloned first) · rechunk (rebuild passages, no parse).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;parse_filter&lt;/b&gt;: IDDOC list · &lt;b&gt;max_parse_files&lt;/b&gt; = 500 · &lt;b&gt;max_source_staleness_hours&lt;/b&gt; = 36 · &lt;b&gt;describe_images&lt;/b&gt; = true · &lt;b&gt;redescribe_all_images&lt;/b&gt; = false." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="jbc5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="580" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
