<mxCell id="jbc72" value="3c_chunks&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:11px;color:#2F6DB5&quot;&gt;CPU · parse_cpu_cluster&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#DCE8F7;strokeColor=#2F6DB5;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#16324F;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;collapsible=0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;swimlaneLine=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="1372" width="580" height="201" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="jbc73" value="&lt;b&gt;Retry&lt;/b&gt;: a failed IDDOC is parsed again with its next-best file.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passages&lt;/b&gt;: cut on headings 1–3; &lt;b&gt;300 / 450 / 550&lt;/b&gt; tokens (min / target / max), ≤ &lt;b&gt;1,950&lt;/b&gt; characters, &lt;b&gt;12 %&lt;/b&gt; overlap; tables split by rows, header repeated.&lt;br&gt;Prefix: [Source: REF | Title | Type | Division | Category | Date].&lt;br&gt;Boilerplate (in ≥ 20 documents) and duplicates marked or removed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cited_codes&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;chunk_preprocessed&lt;/b&gt; (text + canonical codes: SF-1027 → [SF1027]).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quality checks&lt;/b&gt; (Great Expectations): RED stops the task before any write.&lt;br&gt;Documents dated before 2016-01-01 outside the scope roots → archive (none in scope today)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="jbc72"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="580" height="171" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
