<mxCell id="jbc82" value="4_describe_images&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:normal;font-size:11px;color:#D9822B&quot;&gt;CPU · describe_cpu_cluster&lt;/span&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#FDE2C4;strokeColor=#D9822B;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#6B3500;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;collapsible=0;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;swimlaneLine=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="1653" width="580" height="167" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="jbc83" value="Vision LLM on the PENDING images: &lt;b&gt;gpt-6-luna&lt;/b&gt; + &lt;b&gt;gpt-5-6-luna&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;in parallel&lt;/b&gt;, each with its own rate limiter.&lt;br&gt;≤ &lt;b&gt;24&lt;/b&gt; calls in flight per endpoint · budget 80 % of 1 M input / 100 k output tokens per minute (shared with the chat).&lt;br&gt;≤ &lt;b&gt;12,000&lt;/b&gt; images per run; 2 rounds per endpoint; an image failed 10 times → FAILED_LIMIT.&lt;br&gt;The model returns a category (TABLE, FLOWCHART, DIAGRAM…) and the extraction, or SKIP.&lt;br&gt;Description ≥ 40 characters → one &lt;b&gt;image passage&lt;/b&gt;. Scanned pages: full transcription." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="jbc82"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="580" height="137" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
