<mxCell id="jbc92" value="Triggers the sync of &lt;b&gt;chunks_index&lt;/b&gt; and waits up to &lt;b&gt;45 min&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Index: Delta Sync, TRIGGERED, endpoint &lt;b&gt;qualibot&lt;/b&gt;, key chunk_id, embeds &lt;b&gt;chunk_preprocessed&lt;/b&gt; with &lt;b&gt;databricks-qwen3-embedding-0-6b&lt;/b&gt;; created on its first run.&lt;br&gt;UAT only: MERGE of chunks + chunks_archive into &lt;b&gt;chunks_full&lt;/b&gt; (impact search, index not created yet)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="jbc91"><mxGeometry x="0" y="30" width="580" height="103" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
